Package: voltR
Title: VOLT Ranking Contracts for FARO-Admissible Alternatives
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(person(given = "EIKOS", family = "Project", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "pending@example.invalid"))
Description: Implements a first auditable VOLT layer for ranking and comparison
    among alternatives admitted after FARO. The package keeps admissibility,
    weights, performances, ranking, limitations, and provenance inspectable and
    does not replace DIA, convergedR, FARO, or domain-specific packages.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
